 "_doc_exits": "A step's \"doors\" is either a fixed count or [min,max]; ranges are rolled with the seeded stage rng and capped at 3 (StageGen.MAX_EXITS). Each door becomes an exit gate on the edge of the battlefield (see ExitGen). Forced/boss steps stay at 1.",
